 the world! Chaotic 80 player battles.  It can also be played locally with up to 4 players on one computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/677bd7850facd32cb8dfe1d742a3b4cf.avif?t=1746716704\" width=616 height=185 /></span></p>", "short_description": "CLUCK, You're a chicken fighting for your survival in a factory farm. Don't fall into the gruesome grinder or you'll be turned into a chicken nugget. The last chicken standing wins this crazy chaotic game. The winner wears the crown, making them the ultimate nugget master, king of the chickens.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/header.jpg?t=1746716704", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746716704", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746716704", "website": "https://nuggetroyale.io", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-9400F or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 or equivalent<br></li><li><stron